###  Who?

The minimal privileges are:
   1.   **Community Owner**, able to administrate all the events happening in the context of its community 
   2.   **Benchmarking Event Manager**, able to administrate a particular benchmarking Event

### Where?

Access OpenEBench management data platform at:  
  **[https://dev-openebench.bsc.es/nextcloud/](https://dev-openebench.bsc.es/nextcloud/)**

### Login

1. **Click "Login with OpenEBench":**  
   Navigate [https://dev-openebench.bsc.es/nextcloud/](https://dev-openebench.bsc.es/nextcloud/) and click the **"Login with OpenEBench"** button. This will redirect you to authenticate using your OpenEBench credentials.

